OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers at first but these gradually
OL,7,Fclearing to allow some clear spells.
OL,8,FCloudy again in the east later with
OL,9,Fsome showers, staying dry in the
OL,10,Fsouthwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCloudy start with a few mainly
OL,13,Flight showers. Otherwise becoming dry
OL,14,Fwith variable amounts of cloud and
OL,15,Fbright spells.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMainly
OL,18,Fdry although rather cloudy at times
OL,19,Fover the weekend. Dry with more in the
OL,20,Fway of sunshine on Monday.
